// DF-300b: `@align` is not a function attribute — a function is code, and
// there is no storage on it to align. `@export`/`@section` are the two that
// belong there, and the refusal lists them.
// EXPECT: error
// EXPECT-ERROR-CONTAINS: attribute `@align` is not supported on function declarations
@align(8)
func main() {
    print(1)
}
